      "content": "Impressions: I felt calm and appreciative of the clarification, and cautiously interested in continuing the analysis. I remain unwilling to draw a firm investment conclusion from historical figures or unsupported assumptions. I value clear source dates, transparent definitions, and keeping unresolved questions explicitly open.",
